# Al-Moayed (المؤيد) Spec Kit

**Read first:** `.speckit/spec.yaml` · `.speckit/constitution.md`

## Product

Arabic RTL PWA for all educational levels and subjects. Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, Supabase, iron-session, Tailwind, Shadcn/UI.

## Implemented features (do not break)

- **AUTH-001/002/003/006/007** — WhatsApp login, teacher code, session lock, login loading feedback, block inactive teacher/student accounts (FIX-AUTH-002)
- **MT-001/002/003** — Multi-tenant `student_teachers`, teacher switcher, teacher unlink vs admin hard delete
- **QUIZ-001** — Gatekeeper: no answers/explanations until submit
- **QUIZ-002/003** — Weak points + WhatsApp share
- **QUIZ-004** — Timed quiz countdown (teacher duration 1–180; attempt snapshot; auto-submit)
- **GAMIF-001** — Teacher level tiers + student progress/badges (active teacher)
- **GAMIF-004** — Rewards hall horizontal carousel + expand grid
- **GAMIF-002** — Default gamification preset loader on teacher settings
- **TIER-001/002** — Pro gating + upgrade approval
- **TEACH-001–005** — Students, groups, quizzes, bulk import, dashboard stats
- **TEACH-011** — Quiz soft delete → Trash → restore / permanent delete
- **TEACH-012** — Excel/Word sample templates (real `.docx` download + template-driven tests)
- **TEACH-013** — Quick text paste bulk import («لصق نصي سريع»; live preview; append ≤50)
- **TEACH-014** — LMS structured paste (`Qn:`/`Answer:` + optional quiz settings header)
- **TEACH-016** — Plain Unicode math for quick-paste (normalize common LaTeX; no MathJax)
- **TEACH-017** — Friendly teacher quiz URLs (`/teacher/quizzes/[slug]`; UUID 308 redirect)
- **PROFILE-001/002** — Settings + progressive onboarding / quiz profile gate
- **UI-001/002** — RTL mobile shell, StatusBadge
- **UI-006** — Header + global top nav progress (`NavbarProgress`, NProgress `top-nav-loader`)
- **UI-007** — Results card score badge + action layout
- **UI-009** — Quiz timer settings card (presets, status badge, Switch, HubToast save)
- **UI-010** — Login PWA install CTAs (Android beforeinstallprompt + iOS/Android guide modal)
- **ADMIN-001/002** — Super Admin dashboard + runtime platform settings (Demo Mode, Fixed OTP)
- **AUTH-008 / TEACH-015** — Trial join link + teacher invite
- **ENABLE-001** — `data-spekit` hooks via `src/lib/spekit-targets.ts`

## Code rules

1. Scope queries to active `currentTeacherId` for teacher data.
2. Quiz exam API: never return grading fields pre-submission.
3. RTL + touch-friendly UI; no raw native selects/files in new UI.
4. Server Actions only for DB writes; admin Supabase client.
5. Minimal focused diffs; match existing patterns.

## Spekit hooks

Add new targets to `SPEKIT` constant + `.speckit/spekit-targets.yaml`. Use `{...spekit(SPEKIT.id)}` or `data-spekit={SPEKIT.id}`.

## Verify

`npm run build` after changes. Update `.speckit/spec.yaml` when behavior changes.
